## Third-party assets

The art and audio under `assets/` are **not** covered by the licence above.
They come from the Ninja Adventure pack by Pixel-Boy, released under CC0 1.0
(public domain dedication). The pack and the URL it was downloaded from are
recorded in `assets/NinjaAdventure/LICENCE-as-downloaded.md`.

CC0 asks for nothing, but crediting the author costs nothing either, so the
credit stays in that file and in the game's credits.

Anything added to `assets/` later must have its own licence recorded the same
way, before it is committed — see `CONTRIBUTING.md`.
